      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of Mandamus commanding the respondents to ensure that multiplexes will sell food, beverage and drinking water at Maximum Retail Price only."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3a8729769f34907a2d7aac3bf52ed9e_6",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIII. Such any other order or direction under the circumstances of the case also be passed in favour of the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3d19d30e507648758008768473396fea_13",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Paragraphs 23, 25, 31 and 32 of the said judgment read as under:\n\"23."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aca5efe24c3d4345af1c4c0c191f4405_14",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The cinema hall is a private property of the owner of the hall."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "741c5a44113d46ebacdb035e2c841df9_15",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The owner of the hall is entitled to stipulate terms and conditions so long as they are not contrary to public interest, safety and welfare."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3bb6d544d1cf47ec8ec432649d6ae652_16",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Like with any other business, the proprietor or the management is entitled to determine the business model that is to be followed and to give effect to their own conceptions of the economic viability of a particular business model."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d93b0817cf22484f960abea04d2a8f8b_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The owner of a cinema hall is entitled to determine whether she will set up or engage an entity for setting up counters for the sale of food and beverages and to regulate the terms on which such sale should take place."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "16f7c76a08274d889ed4c2301e12c5a6_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A prohibition on carrying food and beverages from outside into the precincts of the movie hall is not contrary to public interest, safety or welfare."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "90fb190146464907b5f2c4d6ebbd1199_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. Respondents 3 and 4 have urged that they ought to be permitted to carry their own food because the cinema halls sell exorbitantly priced food and beverages, which are also not nutritious."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a19a82d7a4104c1f9cada679550a7b13_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The High Court was persuaded to issue the direction which has been noted earlier based on the consideration that what is offered for sale is \"junk food\"."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fd9ecbf1eb49400a8c09c88cfefa9739_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Theatre owners may decide the contents of the menu they offer, similar to restaurants deciding their menu or similar to theatre owners themselves deciding Mamta Singh vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "40e43e7c1fa748d2b1a63973cac0e227_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Home And"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "220ff64c84e9463ea361dc324e06e12c_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "... on 13 May, 2024"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "abdc0adba25f4058bcb1e9f4431d6696_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/95700688/\n2"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "45a9dd536cb446f1820e6766989a28fc_25",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "which movies to screen."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ee8540182394fe7bfab0ead02b74745_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As mentioned above, this is a commercial decision which the theatre owners are entitled to make."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0c61aa3eed2344e9913a811fff0d0f2b_27",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The price point at which the goods and services will be sold is likewise subject to being fixed by the movie theatre."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "56696135d4954797885f140ff4a63a08_28",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether or not the cost of a good or service is affordable or exorbitant is unrelated to the conditions of entry enforced by a business."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8b3dbe86b6041f18c5337dc4ea29535_29",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "31. The condition of entry is imposed as a direct result of the exercise of the right of cinema owners to carry on a business or trade under Article 19(1)(g) of the Constitution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "deb3174306a14b98a8984c904a43083a_30",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The commercial logic of prohibiting movie goers from carrying their own food to the cinema hall is to stimulate and boost a vital aspect of the business ?\nthe sale of food and beverages."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3015d1326d5741719f651b493735ab04_31",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If business owners are not permitted to determine the various facets of their business (in accordance with law), economic activity would come to a grinding halt."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f5c14a3e449b423b971064befe048ee7_32",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "While movie goers may have no choice but to sign on the proverbial dotted line (and thereby not carry any food of their own into the theatre)\nin order to enter the cinema hall and watch a movie of their choice, this does not by itself rende"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fd0d774e517e40beb4d88b55dbe71eb4_33",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "32. Most businesses impose some or the other condition which the customer may find less than ideal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "47ee7759d79e485b86f56b6e8942b829_34",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For instance, many private museums do not permit customers to take photographs of the objects on display."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b6fd8cac433d4d6b910e343c08e03e6e_35",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This is also true of many clothing boutiques or jewellery stores."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d3701af2473a409eb8d33f7dffef85da_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Audience members are often banned from recording musical performances at concerts."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb92822eff73418d99099bb2dee18fe0_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Music festivals, much like movie theatres, do not permit attendees to carry their own food or beverages to the venue."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "147e83dd8f684aa29557cd7760195536_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Similar is the case with stand-up comedy shows or plays that are conducted in collaboration with eateries or bars."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d2abe6895a4f4b659704a65367a96329_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Although the customer is paying for a ticket to watch the music performance (or the standup act or the play, as the case may be), the essence of the business model is to provide a fillip to the revenue generated by another arm of the busine"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9667ed18b2d54f0e9439c8a0a940cb0a_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This being the case, movie goers are bound by the condition of entry determined by the theatre owners in the instant case i.e., the prohibition on carrying food and beverages from outside into the precincts of the movie hall.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e6dc5e8340c54282b7942922e964889b_41",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "6. In view of the aforesaid, we see no reason to proceed in the matter any further."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "16dd546331a741908c7f47cc3c2509e4_42",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n7. Petition is disposed of in terms of the aforesaid judgment."
    }
